NOTE ON BUNDLED DATA

The dental lexicon in src/dentascribe/dental/data/ is derived from MeSH (public
domain, U.S. National Library of Medicine) and RxNorm (NLM, open access), merged
with an original hand-written seed list. It contains no CDT procedure codes and
no SNODENT content: both are American Dental Association copyright and require a
paid commercial licence to redistribute.

Model weights are NOT bundled and are downloaded separately under their own
licences: Parakeet-TDT (CC-BY-4.0, NVIDIA), Whisper (MIT, OpenAI), Silero VAD
(MIT), Qwen3 (Apache-2.0, Alibaba).
